      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61aa9de055a9934077d442fc|full_name}: Not that I'm aware of. I know Youtube has \"Watch later\". It would be interesting to have something like that for worlds on VRC so you don't have to favorite it and then delete it.",
