  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-30T03:56:46.240Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I thought it would be a cool feature to have a \"Save Worlds for Later\" feature. Doing this should let users browse worlds and add worlds that interest them in a query where they can later visit. After the person visits the world, it will go away automatically from their query. I think this will allow people to explore a variety of worlds instead of seeking them on the search menu and visiting them one at a time. A simple way to explain it would be this feature being as if the watch later feature on Youtube.",
